p,q)&gt;0$\">$d(p,q)&gt;0$</span>.  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard%23lem%3Adc-ch7-2-5-chart\">↗ lem:dc-ch7-2-5-chart</a> \\sketch Apply the short-curve neighborhood lemma to <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$S=M\\smallsetminus \\{ q\\} $\">$S=M\\smallsetminus \\{ q\\} $</span>, obtaining <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$c&gt;0$\">$c&gt;0$</span> such that <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(p,x)&lt;c$\">$d(p,x)&lt;c$</span> implies <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x\\in S$\">$x\\in S$</span>. Since <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q\\notin S$\">$q\\notin S$</span>, <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(p,q)\\ge c&gt;0$\">$d(p,q)\\ge c&gt;0$</span>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-5-chart","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#prop:dc-ch7-2-5","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#def:dc-ch7-2-4","title":"def:dc-ch7-2-4","label":"def:dc-ch7-2-4"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#lem:dc-ch7-2-5-chart","title":"lem:dc-ch7-2-5-chart","label":"lem:dc-ch7-2-5-chart"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_CompleteManifoldsHopfRinowHadamard#prop:dc-ch7-2-5","title":"prop:dc-ch7-2-5","label":"prop:dc-ch7-2-5"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch07_Co